 [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019f6c79-6211-734f-b05c-a5a3401c8a6b)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"aba2eaf634f1b7e5f1717f265297a19dab6c5bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/aba2eaf634f1b7e5f1717f265297a19dab6c5bad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3da6e471c26f1da4cddeb12a435bab92bd7866c6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWZw6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvcsQAAs4Ur28GaFLuA/YC6omhSDx\nC5bNBG11rB+SMaZCAihMu0NlzolDmHw1Eh9DZdKaT+4181V6uU5ddfZA+mh6bKLm\nQv6d2zhWsosDEhEjU6k/9p/7FRX0XHz+jWPfkVtagIC34JHp+/ytrLtxq99TeNXx\nPZW8OV5e7+CmElihBnl3eBWq5qjyAEtROlID/b9I2wkZCyYJ1+cAV9O6EZM6/zQ4\nG3ib75WJ03r7HiuU2Wq+G5WREeAYuZLQcqjJY91L/vMSVHppGFyzG6DGlhTDBxB/\n53t4S3cuucxzO8FVARgja9Y0sws5XDoe5h9uiBx6m3jZ13I02skTN8x1tzQZ3Hv2\n7zZ92XCxR9MlU/N3QbWWNOZAfQV/EfaaP+Ouilf4e92KZXJfs1zgPs5wjH16gWLa\nrzufgfSTWRK958mfLG2u6OwhRUmC44j17cTiBm1XqzAFkIpwjG4ACG++NQXuF5+4\nuWg1XLPUukmaCcYKT9vNYTnHY6aHRHu6a886FkSZaL9LAqa+VwWrVhuZtxq7BEt3\nZhEzCNmZstLnzMazkKGuefdAaKyncW7zqkpgqwrfwOn8sN5AFzswk8q8VPkGrMQh\nw2Cm2+kRI81KtEbrhSnWf736zUC3dWZd+ZO4qfkR7YI4lhbjJt7WzxjTgkSp1Qve\n4hRj3tL+3vWlwR51Vy1w\n=3abH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree aba2eaf634f1b7e5f1717f265297a19dab6c5bad\nparent 3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1784257594 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784257594 -0400\n\nfeat(code): make plugins generally available (#4797)\n\nPlugins are now available by default in deepagents-code without setting\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL`.\n\nThis removes the flag gates from CLI and slash-command discovery, plugin\nskills and MCP loading, and reload behavior while preserving the flag\nfor unrelated experimental features.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019f6c79-6211-734f-b05c-a5a3401c8a6b)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-17T03:06:34Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3da6e471c26f1da4cddeb12a435bab92bd7866c6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3da6e471c26f1da4cddeb12a435bab92bd7866c6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3da6e471c26f1da4cddeb12a435bab92bd7866c6/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602"}]},{"sha":"3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDNiMmZmY2U5MjNlMDYzNzBlZmUxNzdlOWNhOTFmNzBlODZmMTk2MDI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-17T02:47:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-17T02:47:49Z"},"message":"fix(code): avoid blocking MCP OAuth token refresh (#4770)\n\nFixes MCP OAuth token refresh crashing tool calls under `langgraph dev`\nwith a `NodeCancelledError`.\n\n---\n\nOAuth refresh previously performed token-file work synchronously.\nBlockBuster could interrupt that work, cancel session initialization,\nand leave its `AsyncExitStack` to be finalized from another task. Users\nthen saw errors such as:\n\nAttempted to exit cancel scope in a different task than it was entered\nin\n\nToken-file I/O now runs in worker threads. Writes are serialized, token\nand expiry values are read from one snapshot, and cancellation waits for\ntoken writes and refresh-lock acquisition or release to finish before\npropagating. Partial MCP sessions are closed by the task that created\nthem without hiding the original failure.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f2133e26368a49b76e6c67efce17cea6775a6c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5f2133e26368a49b76e6c67efce17cea6775a6c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWZfVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACSoQAKxq+NBUvg7dWAuUB0z8lyVB\ngAOSLTdfxghM3l/V87tftPRcBVs/N5U6m6+BPNzZnmFlkxUSeUtGSfkEe8zTHogg\nXOoXPK/D1CDDGsiGuNxEycNpIe8Xwu8GY8wthKjhu06YUlIGrI3l+peL8T+6hGlD\nKib/J63zICAAsx0A7DSbCUusUOJa6TCj5PRsupKHlcFCdJkW2XwZmHUdLubQOBuB\nvBivWchJas02LgXzg62J3DzOGa1ycU2U6xgafgYv0/W6qBv01XTZT5r8hX8aRSzZ\n3/etLkhQNlX1rCyrkIQ9k4onwBTNVIXPw3RFI+d/T3mUqsj178pREbwZhtEPoTx2\nPl6yQy9hgH6TP0/l9b3ESN+vF+tqk8+rEDL50+sK3tN3Fg0vsb/F/BiIAo6nk/eM\nmQsCrPlHM8DVhIb4VT7W/GlDafCKvoN1Hj8cuYVx/6DI59CpDleUkUTTOZ0UnNyc\nM4hfYjnausWaPisLuSXEk63kv74YL+gZ4wd54DdhpPhQQbHgWrTx3Pvta2UQMlE4\njnq3f0iiSkcrAdHKK8TfkUjigxIwCDrVcX1K5TenKGEmj0tMexKlS7H81M1QI7KB\nFi1FC9+2LDd9Gb4QB3N3WV3CG+MiRvnlrX7rVbYre33be1kzC+MASfFaHflgxkOa\nHqG1EAsnHkAbNPXtIkbr\n=J0xy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5f2133e26368a49b76e6c67efce17cea6775a6c2\nparent 0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784256469 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784256469 -0400\n\nfix(code): avoid blocking MCP OAuth token refresh (#4770)\n\nFixes MCP OAuth token refresh crashing tool calls under `langgraph dev`\nwith a `NodeCancelledError`.\n\n---\n\nOAuth refresh previously performed token-file work synchronously.\nBlockBuster could interrupt that work, cancel session initialization,\nand leave its `AsyncExitStack` to be finalized from another task. Users\nthen saw errors such as:\n\nAttempted to exit cancel scope in a different task than it was entered\nin\n\nToken-file I/O now runs in worker threads. Writes are serialized, token\nand expiry values are read from one snapshot, and cancellation waits for\ntoken writes and refresh-lock acquisition or release to finish before\npropagating. Partial MCP sessions are closed by the task that created\nthem without hiding the original failure.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-17T02:47:49Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3b2ffce923e06370efe177e9ca91f70e86f19602/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001"}]},{"sha":"0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDBkMWJiNmExMjI0YjkxY2FlOWRjZGI3MDE0YTY0MTBhODJiNzkwMDE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Johannes du Plessis","email":"johannes@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-17T02:30:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-17T02:30:15Z"},"message":"fix(code): add marketplaces asynchronously (#4766)\n\nPlugin marketplaces are now added asynchronously with visible progress\nand recoverable errors.\n\n---\n\nMarketplace additions now run in a Textual thread worker so repository\nand network work cannot block the UI. The modal displays an animated\nspinner, prevents duplicate submissions and cancellation while busy, and\nrestores the source field with an actionable error after failure.\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"867\" height=\"1004\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-16 at 11 44\n16 AM\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/031831a0-aa97-4d43-ac9b-e7cbcd7ce13f\"\n/>\n\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019f6785-019d-75b7-86c1-c35cc55cdf5d)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"f96529638172e57ffa835dc5c8dc3b79b5bb89f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f96529638172e57ffa835dc5c8dc3b79b5bb89f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWZO3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFLcQADJAjiaG70LKAOgMZZ2Dc5sx\ndCqgsmAkhVNf+j9nJahhyDuK48gtWrSbd5CXH7ZodfaipSZXd2e4BZb6BL3fHxmh\npNpMiUTlUWQRMHY7x5KpTdQoid5KH0nbSUT1dV49SCWf9n0CMkrjgRl7MZcIufIU\nwLSw6hBIhefxHoP9OSxuA5vBC3rPgqcZovmtZ+fqcs0F8IrMipfjN3vGDkAMfG4+\nss+38Geo0xUID/ol9do9/I+zDYqfy0/GjBrfJqlUI0gYAS/H5zgvQhUciRJ+uP1H\nBtLD7v2NW94h1vWwYb7Kax7SV/7dBVZicmzOOwtGzYXCJ/Kz9hcCH9jE1D4Bbxe9\nK/aD4g5bHBkq/6GrtHF+hWeT20M5mmiH0xwfMjacWw7tD38vIcnCsXggrnUBMSDC\nMgWfeVMSod2Eizd744D6LrFKO6crEpsGZq2RKXRo8cKa1/xciY4fT8vMnEIPeq5W\nn2bMumQIzhhQOIctWCT8nIPNevF5Q5IqzmIrsclBC+siW5HzcsFSTGCCtsrhUcp4\noD8aY4wtRPPOtr8HjTrmqlkVmKuO08/cEY/64L7Rjt40JC8j1dHan7lRQRNYyPmE\ntbftzUav4w7bHiQ3EyLYOIk4z1n3CoGP8VOANIupCkNerJLTC7oCfULhRZ13xFCy\ncCDN+FXKOJntAT5FUNa6\n=TlJB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f96529638172e57ffa835dc5c8dc3b79b5bb89f9\nparent 9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1784255415 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784255415 -0400\n\nfix(code): add marketplaces asynchronously (#4766)\n\nPlugin marketplaces are now added asynchronously with visible progress\nand recoverable errors.\n\n---\n\nMarketplace additions now run in a Textual thread worker so repository\nand network work cannot block the UI. The modal displays an animated\nspinner, prevents duplicate submissions and cancellation while busy, and\nrestores the source field with an actionable error after failure.\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"867\" height=\"1004\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-16 at 11 44\n16 AM\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/031831a0-aa97-4d43-ac9b-e7cbcd7ce13f\"\n/>\n\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019f6785-019d-75b7-86c1-c35cc55cdf5d)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-07-17T02:30:16Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0d1bb6a1224b91cae9dcdb7014a6410a82b79001/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6"}]},{"sha":"9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDljYWQyZjAwZGQwNDczODI4ZjgwZjc4MmM4ODliOTM5NDgzNzI3ZjY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Johannes du Plessis","email":"johannes@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-17T01:38:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-17T01:38:52Z"},"message":"feat(code): summarize plugin changes on reload (#4767)\n\nPlugin management now reminds users to reload and `/reload` summarizes\nplugin changes.\n\n---\n\nSurfaces a `/reload` reminder after relevant plugin-manager changes and\ncompares the pre-change plugin state with reload discovery. The reload\nreport now summarizes added, removed, and changed plugins.\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"862\" height=\"447\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-16 at 11 19 51 AM\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1900856b-7ddb-47a1-8bc2-d5dbfb8701cc\"\n/>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019f6784-519d-73cc-9f67-9a46c88d1de9)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6b4a90aa41f3089d369682a3eda530e53436b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b6b4a90aa41f3089d369682a3eda530e53436b58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWYesCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHmsQAGER8SwLe6NvVJMKe8mgTsDK\nfEEHhBYoWNeUgviYjm4HNf29MSAOS5ErCnxAXzP5KZuNw/XpodXoYxB/NBRCHKV1\nKn7dhZudt+Fju/5JTNrW03Xk7ezQgBZN0nYM46Rfek5G/PC/zvoMnv6yfQkwJspd\n30I4XAJw4pLCkzCb6/6BvOvbAq1QmMGgjUIH8B1LWt9kJov9ZOXN2VrXBzBvZFxm\nZGi3BNXKcEejcFwAOs5oKtn6l9IlbFX/q1cGl8sbOQzM+xmQocrBCb7Llm8ztBEB\nxPWXsNqhBSb76XWxRPvZbOJ9oj8Fr/nKQ7/DMLgX6ZBB7RfOCXVquMSiQmeJyRX2\naBIl0VQJ/ubtdz22JViSEau+xXjq2MxTEPt0ptPqM38V8QUYFWxF7mRARF1g3SJl\nAcFELplatG6WjOKbdVIwNcWkcEcRHWlgYVWwjppA9jHpgGfvd9X25JeUpnxaCyNR\n+J6YldWogQTED9SK9l/SjdsXyGBVBe7mb1WMCz3OXIVsqojsqlQOnOy8mHS5w6lf\n9ow6PM0wFV9aShmP0/FSdcPBlzg0VjPUSs8XMZ/f8GrkBSXITpaBs00gUPt7KHVC\nYG4wlbj4EIFJavnqXjQprf5J7Ic8pxnFhcMyWUQ4vjW+kvAkV8ycBFj5hyApT0Kk\nQPcTDthIP8fcV/qIWCM9\n=JMnh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b6b4a90aa41f3089d369682a3eda530e53436b58\nparent 671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1784252332 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784252332 -0400\n\nfeat(code): summarize plugin changes on reload (#4767)\n\nPlugin management now reminds users to reload and `/reload` summarizes\nplugin changes.\n\n---\n\nSurfaces a `/reload` reminder after relevant plugin-manager changes and\ncompares the pre-change plugin state with reload discovery. The reload\nreport now summarizes added, removed, and changed plugins.\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"862\" height=\"447\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-16 at 11 19 51 AM\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1900856b-7ddb-47a1-8bc2-d5dbfb8701cc\"\n/>\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019f6784-519d-73cc-9f67-9a46c88d1de9)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-17T01:38:53Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9cad2f00dd0473828f80f782c889b939483727f6/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e"}]},{"sha":"671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDY3MWM1NzgwMDY4NGQ3ZmRlOWNmZWE2OTVhYjg4YjNkMjA5ZTY3N2U","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-16T21:45:06Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-16T21:45:06Z"},"message":"feat(evals): flat cross-category shard pool for unified evals (#4745)\n\n## What\n\nReplace the serialized per-provider / per-category eval jobs with one\ndynamically-drained **per-model pool spanning all three categories**. A\nshard is a 1-task unit carrying its own `(category, dataset, agent_impl,\ntask)`; `unified_prep` emits a per-model flat matrix and one `eval` job\ndrains it. `max_parallel`/`model_parallel` are **derived** from\n`concurrency`+`rollouts`; `MAX_SHARDS` 64→200 with proportional\nper-category packing above the cap. Per-category aggregation keeps the\ntier-2 scorecard (`aggregate_unified.py`) unchanged. `harbor.yml`'s\nsingle-dataset path decouples `shard_parallel` from `n_shards` for\ndynamic dispatch (no-op at the default `n_shards=10`).\n\n## Validated (CI, docker sandbox, bare harness)\n\n- **Lite single-model** (`gpt-5.6-terra`): complete scorecard across all\n3 categories, macro pass@3 0.479 (context 0.0 → 0.625 after the fixes\nbelow).\n- **Multi-model** (`gpt-5.6-terra` + `anthropic:claude-sonnet-5`): both\nper-model pools run concurrently under `model_parallel`, total-job guard\nholds (68 shards), and the non-OpenAI agent runs with the OpenAI judge.\n\n## Fixes folded in (found during the dry-runs)\n\n- Context corpus populate + judge `OPENAI_API_KEY` now read the\nper-shard `matrix.*` values (they were gated on the leaf inputs, which\nthe flat design leaves empty).\n- LangSmith experiment name scoped per category (fixes the cross-dataset\nrun double-count).\n\n## Dependency\n\nNeeds the harbor build-lock fix\n([harbor-framework/harbor#2340](https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor/pull/2340))\nvia `harbor_package_override` until it's released — pin\n`nick-hollon-lc/harbor@27a6eac8` meanwhile.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ad3f56557db865190a7f57199a15a826677de31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/9ad3f56557db865190a7f57199a15a826677de31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWVDiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6f4QAJcXFFYhPJ+ujkvfb81hBv4+\nHismxKjnLMVB8cg03DVY9AxWT9JEA3MSHwxXjtNNZV5U7zGX5I1iWapx8j9Qmrq6\n0HIpu9lw25l5agPXmlW/Ck8CPIclTOb5iAWz4ceAAi3Ph4srF/sUYLGhZ6WN+byJ\ni8Ie6kQkI+x4yLK+MFgiDTRZzbGJrSX7XpdUJGLltwHhgOAsNwgiYA9kPh/yJ0mO\nPHHQC/zHv64wgoNhCBVd2V4IZs2gzOi77v1RLvenN+Y1PHdZqR6dwzMYfzbBo/W7\nk9/r2JpdEWPPKrBINyuniGJrYZsirc+KX54Di/PHSZyxBmgCe65+KpMzn4LPPMkn\nH5JKqVZzji0im9Kvu5lgw/xnJ/8V07SE3tNidqNaROaCWozIeYPFPaUnyUZYYjKs\n2ixyZ14YF5VCShDnWnktz0Q7cRJQjw/RTRwik6MqTr/Z2gH9Y7kKXNxD5SwrJOPX\nn6eDtPEj2nXvN5PFqbsbao38OvMBXZkW2GsNPT/rfG6p5tiLUjpokvi/gXyDq5aL\nHA9DB2D5IA7YGAYY5RQGQcVLSOxjHD7r9OIvIhLBDtUOyxk679juYMoJ8iiRDipY\niGK0Zer++2mEg5qPpzqnGbDFcfPNP0SN/Jzm56I4R2zwnt+urlwaqHpsIHVFzMX1\nr+oNDxI8EPF59p/OW5Yj\n=t8bO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9ad3f56557db865190a7f57199a15a826677de31\nparent 99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1784238306 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784238306 -0400\n\nfeat(evals): flat cross-category shard pool for unified evals (#4745)\n\n## What\n\nReplace the serialized per-provider / per-category eval jobs with one\ndynamically-drained **per-model pool spanning all three categories**. A\nshard is a 1-task unit carrying its own `(category, dataset, agent_impl,\ntask)`; `unified_prep` emits a per-model flat matrix and one `eval` job\ndrains it. `max_parallel`/`model_parallel` are **derived** from\n`concurrency`+`rollouts`; `MAX_SHARDS` 64→200 with proportional\nper-category packing above the cap. Per-category aggregation keeps the\ntier-2 scorecard (`aggregate_unified.py`) unchanged. `harbor.yml`'s\nsingle-dataset path decouples `shard_parallel` from `n_shards` for\ndynamic dispatch (no-op at the default `n_shards=10`).\n\n## Validated (CI, docker sandbox, bare harness)\n\n- **Lite single-model** (`gpt-5.6-terra`): complete scorecard across all\n3 categories, macro pass@3 0.479 (context 0.0 → 0.625 after the fixes\nbelow).\n- **Multi-model** (`gpt-5.6-terra` + `anthropic:claude-sonnet-5`): both\nper-model pools run concurrently under `model_parallel`, total-job guard\nholds (68 shards), and the non-OpenAI agent runs with the OpenAI judge.\n\n## Fixes folded in (found during the dry-runs)\n\n- Context corpus populate + judge `OPENAI_API_KEY` now read the\nper-shard `matrix.*` values (they were gated on the leaf inputs, which\nthe flat design leaves empty).\n- LangSmith experiment name scoped per category (fixes the cross-dataset\nrun double-count).\n\n## Dependency\n\nNeeds the harbor build-lock fix\n([harbor-framework/harbor#2340](https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor/pull/2340))\nvia `harbor_package_override` until it's released — pin\n`nick-hollon-lc/harbor@27a6eac8` meanwhile.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-16T21:45:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/671c57800684d7fde9cfea695ab88b3d209e677e/comments","author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274035459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-hollon-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f"}]},{"sha":"99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDk5MjUwZWUxNzQ5Yzk3N2U5NTM4OWJhYWZkZTNkMzU4Yzk1M2VhMGY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-16T21:23:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-16T21:23:14Z"},"message":"feat(code): add `reconnect`/`connect` hidden keywords for `/restart` (#4807)\n\nTyping \"reconnect\" or \"connect\" in the slash-command autocomplete now\nsurfaces the `/restart` command, which respawns the agent server.\n\nAdds `reconnect` and `connect` to the `hidden_keywords` for the\n`/restart` `SlashCommand` entry so fuzzy matching finds it under those\ncommon terms. These keywords are never displayed and don't appear in the\ncommands catalog, so no regeneration is needed.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/05f60126-f5ea-25a4-3b3b-84127a4a529b)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"83e6f3474f3910a48939192928ceca06a7745ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/83e6f3474f3910a48939192928ceca06a7745ef2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWUvCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFEwQAI3PQ6Jo+mgvCwPUabhpDJK/\nf1rUiydiVBTDDoidH3PNilVobJVAUEJqkoW+tfmqkfTunrP+laLMvrDWo68ENFrA\nreujbVVpQOXMuOtIQGfvM28xu3glkgwr9ggOf8vles/VCqJN8rZkASB1TroZkANo\nx7bxVB4/OQuzt0b4IywDlbPLkGNLkcqpI0KwNjIB3MV2niwXkQ8x1/Sci8i7bBHh\nBvJE58PhYipNBOuEhXxTVv8MDq4+67Hz5Janq5NiuMxtXGVnjTgKl72raQPVEXnQ\nGXPRLt6uQ1KpD/8Cs7QyQbswdZhntEogJtvG9AmFRXd9AR2MIFfmLtXh35Aum4rN\nD01GI5lDICFLS9IqpfXZ9F4ZcGnX7TWFxQO5d0MdVYWRfb6nznKqSr4HEdJKB8Ty\nLvoLrBP5GUb2Rw3IP8zS3E2r5DDwJuHDCbLmKc9fvTSN9OJOTkVjgSc/tllKsPfX\nUYmwuyPAE3moZdTg1/R9KesocHmqiHeXh3DWN5pLYQ5ApP2WdtzMkEt7bQcWR/n+\n/oSEBLLtXPzcK+OZ8glzqL3+pUtlEeDQVT/TB3PybJIaFYfCV+vtR8D3xiMHkXS8\nPLICQkNwWM/eviN10b0yB3Vllt9BfydfaDCkuSiP6ATdYsqGL2wCFGzjvpHmdEit\nQ0HU0qt9ckPdJLQOJFUl\n=jItD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 83e6f3474f3910a48939192928ceca06a7745ef2\nparent a6c20b1a4d2a8b8a03690460a30c501ab7fbb6cb\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784236994 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784236994 -0400\n\nfeat(code): add `reconnect`/`connect` hidden keywords for `/restart` (#4807)\n\nTyping \"reconnect\" or \"connect\" in the slash-command autocomplete now\nsurfaces the `/restart` command, which respawns the agent server.\n\nAdds `reconnect` and `connect` to the `hidden_keywords` for the\n`/restart` `SlashCommand` entry so fuzzy matching finds it under those\ncommon terms. These keywords are never displayed and don't appear in the\ncommands catalog, so no regeneration is needed.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/05f60126-f5ea-25a4-3b3b-84127a4a529b)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-16T21:23:15Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/99250ee1749c977e95389baafde3d358c953ea0f/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"a6c20b1a4d2a8b8a03690460a30c501ab7fbb6cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a6c20b1a4d2a8b8a03690460a30c501ab7fbb6cb","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a6c20b1a4d2a8b8a03690460a30c501ab7fbb6cb"}]},{"sha":"a6c20b1a4d2a8b8a03690460a30c501ab7fbb6cb","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGE2YzIwYjFhNGQyYThiOGEwMzY5MDQ2MGEzMGM1MDFhYjdmYmI2Y2I","commit":{"author":{"name":"Johannes du Plessis","email":"johannes@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-16T21:19:35Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-16T21:19:35Z"},"message":"feat(code): add plugin list search (#4765)\n\nPlugin screens now support filtering available and installed plugins by\nname or description.\n\n---\n\nAdd keyboard-accessible search to available and installed plugin lists\nso users can filter by plugin name or description, clear searches with\nEscape, and see explicit no-results states.\n\n## Screenshots\n<img width=\"860\" height=\"987\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-16 at 11 27 22 AM\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/523be30d-c3cd-4aae-bb36-5441c3454d6b\"\n/>\n\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/019f6784-b613-735d-bb42-f6e0c69c3956)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com