 and error.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"ce2b486f00daa4d5af27df40ffa7f413cf8ba1ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/ce2b486f00daa4d5af27df40ffa7f413cf8ba1ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7d707b840f132ad65e5ac8443ec7fece393180f8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWRsbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAx8QQABR/dMFxn5Zu9Mf9nVKtCASB\n9JdDeae5KPKy361FC+ogGiWnktG9sCFe3aSgrNMZZfId8qkPIbp0DZ09eM5s8fTA\nyr/yrjRh53zAEzN6nzqX+DV4EG3xE2okXEhiRPfycbcpC16QG94SodvSoLoO6s7y\nOdl9p0ciT7JXT2XgDvoGsqpp3kNgPwI5dKAWs6qqGCDQN/0bGhqfzCCVgk86M/nz\nHozTJPf+L/JXiH/S1o0FJOhIidywxaw6YMaKCCiDnbWI7L4AUl84NQ46xbW4ltgg\nhQKNk451HiXP/gHGdiYIKG4y+UENkQ4xqRqv++W/bNswUCA4zZIkinEtcpk/rll5\nr8+GcqSBnzecDUbIQNSmJFrBZLi9JTkxjq8/nDNMleerqNXuPitQWaGDSx1qa95G\nmvGoqwPDeGKSKgBBEOBH8FJzqa1bS0ll5V5069dQYjgtIhtVjoKhu0DfK9kvKDyU\nJcZQvAQnPJ/M0bg1Klv6hGkAu7XFaAlgd+Y2JWftEIk0lK5GB9XMj0HRO+bWPEpn\nrikvD8Aglv+B3pdWxjkK8Zkzrq1qQgfSOWzPc2Y7TFVdFdpJ3OHZ6lsQyxUQ/lFv\nTM1T4OrWJEDFgj871mTlLvAf3HMu2EdaOo5jF+ko0y79AH1OogFl7GgoidQJJ1nX\nwrKVzmsvUlgWky2Nli52\n=M/sZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ce2b486f00daa4d5af27df40ffa7f413cf8ba1ee\nparent ab2e101d02d0fc5be45b0581c4e04d441402dc29\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1784224539 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784224539 +0000\n\nfix(code): clarify plugin component discovery and reload status (#4774)\n\nCloses\n[DCD-49](https://linear.app/langchain/issue/DCD-49/plugins-fix-installed-component-discovery-and-status-messaging)\n\nPlugin manager status and component messaging now reflect what\ndeepagents-code actually loads, and Enabled only appears after\n`/reload`.\n\n---\n\nPlugins that only ship `agents/`/`commands/`/`ho