.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7d8f708147b3b54477563a37b86f5272651c2cdf","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7d8f708147b3b54477563a37b86f5272651c2cdf"}]},{"sha":"7d8f708147b3b54477563a37b86f5272651c2cdf","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDdkOGY3MDgxNDdiM2I1NDQ3NzU2M2EzN2I4NmY1MjcyNjUxYzJjZGY","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-15T10:57:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-15T10:57:02Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump the minor-and-patch group with 2 updates (#4747)\n\nBumps the minor-and-patch group with 2 updates:\n[CodSpeedHQ/action](https://github.com/codspeedhq/action) and\n[dorny/paths-filter](https://github.com/dorny/paths-filter).\n\nUpdates `CodSpeedHQ/action` from 4.18.1 to 4.18.5\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/codspeedhq/action/releases\">CodSpeedHQ/action's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.18.5</h2>\n<h2>Release Notes</h2>\n<h3><!-- raw HTML omitted -->💼 Other</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump pinned valgrind-codspeed to <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/valgrind-codspeed/releases/tag/3.26.0-0codspeed6\">3.26.0-0codspeed6</a>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/codspeedhq/action/issues/448\">#448</a>)\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/adriencaccia\"><code>@​adriencaccia</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/CodSpeedHQ/runner/pull/448\">#448</a>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: hangs on ARM64 due to atomics by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/not-matthias\"><code>@​not-matthias</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/CodSpeedHQ/valgrind-codspeed/pull/23\">CodSpeedHQ/valgrind-codspeed#23</a></li>\n<li>fix(aspacem): raise amd64 managed address ceiling to 1 TiB by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/not-matthias\"><code>@​not-matthias</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/CodSpeedHQ/valgrind-codspeed/pull/22\">CodSpeedHQ/valgrind-codspeed#22</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Install codspeed-runner 4.18.4</h2>\n<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>\n<pre lang=\"sh\"><code>curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf\nhttps://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.4/codspeed-runner-installer.sh\n| sh\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Download codspeed-runner 4.18.4</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>File</th>\n<th>Platform</th>\n<th>Checksum</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.4/codspeed-runner-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\">codspeed-runner-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz</a></td>\n<td>Apple Silicon macOS</td>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.4/codspeed-runner-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256\">checksum</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.4/codspeed-runner-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\">codspeed-runner-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz</a></td>\n<td>ARM64 MUSL Linux</td>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.4/codspeed-runner-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256\">checksum</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.4/codspeed-runner-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\">codspeed-runner-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz</a></td>\n<td>x64 MUSL Linux</td>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.4/codspeed-runner-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256\">checksum</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Full Runner Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</a></p>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/compare/v4.18.4...v4.18.5\">https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/compare/v4.18.4...v4.18.5</a></p>\n<h2>v4.18.4</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix 4.18.3 runner hash – bf19f56fe8857e83e4343138c1a927e56f666e3b by\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/adriencaccia\"><code>@​adriencaccia</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/compare/v4.18.3...v4.18.4\">https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/compare/v4.18.3...v4.18.4</a></p>\n<h2>v4.18.2</h2>\n<h2>Release Notes</h2>\n<h3><!-- raw HTML omitted -->🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Source forwarded env below memtrack's capability boundary by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/not-matthias\"><code>@​not-matthias</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/CodSpeedHQ/runner/pull/439\">#439</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><!-- raw HTML omitted -->⚙️ Internals</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>chore: bump runner version to 4.18.2 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/github-actions\"><code>@​github-actions</code></a>[bot]\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/pull/219\">CodSpeedHQ/action#219</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Install codspeed-runner 4.18.2</h2>\n<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/f99becdce5e5d51fd556489ebef684f4ecfd6286\"><code>f99becd</code></a>\nRelease v4.18.5 🚀</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/e7968482c47971f1fcfb4ddf4fc1f8f1e12d6527\"><code>e796848</code></a>\nchore: bump runner version to 4.18.4</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/9f3a37ece7abc84992501a7fcd54d1704f3458fa\"><code>9f3a37e</code></a>\nRelease v4.18.4 🚀</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/bf19f56fe8857e83e4343138c1a927e56f666e3b\"><code>bf19f56</code></a>\nfix: use correct 4.18.3 runner hash</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/eea136791682a28c919fed3838920681d1959d14\"><code>eea1367</code></a>\nRelease v4.18.3 🚀</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/183fe0f979b7419e65b0313af6674864c74d995c\"><code>183fe0f</code></a>\nchore: bump runner version to 4.18.3 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/codspeedhq/action/issues/220\">#220</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/4e969336ab9acd4f6f8d025fdd793292b0835df0\"><code>4e96933</code></a>\nRelease v4.18.2 🚀</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/action/commit/9de6ea27e5a66f0f45c75d0d248a6538b1b39c7c\"><code>9de6ea2</code></a>\nchore: bump runner version to 4.18.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/codspeedhq/action/issues/219\">#219</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/codspeedhq/action/compare/a4a36bb07c0638b0b4ca52bf1f3dad1b4289e52f...f99becdce5e5d51fd556489ebef684f4ecfd6286\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `dorny/paths-filter` from 4.0.1 to 4.0.2\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dorny/paths-filter/releases\">dorny/paths-filter's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.0.2</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix warning message by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cgundy\"><code>@​cgundy</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/282\">dorny/paths-filter#282</a></li>\n<li>chore: fix GitHub spelling in logs by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/squat\"><code>@​squat</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/278\">dorny/paths-filter#278</a></li>\n<li>fix: use rev-parse instead of branch --show-current for older git\ncompat by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/saschabratton\"><code>@​saschabratton</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/303\">dorny/paths-filter#303</a></li>\n<li>fix: work around git dubious ownership errors in container jobs by\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/saschabratton\"><code>@​saschabratton</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/317\">dorny/paths-filter#317</a></li>\n<li>docs: update changelog for v4.0.2 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/saschabratton\"><code>@​saschabratton</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/318\">dorny/paths-filter#318</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/cgundy\"><code>@​cgundy</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/282\">dorny/paths-filter#282</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/squat\"><code>@​squat</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/278\">dorny/paths-filter#278</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dorny/paths-filter/compare/v4.0.1...v4.0.2\">https://github.com/dorny/paths-filter/compare/v4.0.1...v4.0.2</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dorny/paths-filter/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md\">dorny/paths-filter's\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>Changelog</h1>\n<h2>v4.0.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/317\">Work\naround git dubious ownership errors in container jobs</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/303\">Use\nrev-parse instead of branch --show-current for older git compat</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/282\">Fix\nwarning message</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v4.0.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/255\">Support\nmerge queue</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v4.0.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/294\">Update\naction runtime to node24</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v3.0.3</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/279\">Add\nmissing predicate-quantifier</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v3.0.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/224\">Add\nconfig parameter for predicate quantifier</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v3.0.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/133\">Compare\nbase and ref when token is empty</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v3.0.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/210\">Update to\nNode.js 20</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/215\">Update\nall dependencies</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v2.11.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/167\">Update\n@​actions/core to v1.10.0 - Fixes warning about deprecated\nset-output</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/168\">Document\nneed for pull-requests: read permission</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/164\">Updating\nto actions/checkout@v3</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v2.11.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/157\">Set\nlist-files input parameter as not required</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/161\">Update\nNode.js</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/162\">Fix\nincorrect handling of Unicode characters in exec()</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/163\">Use\nOctokit pagination</a></li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/160\">Updates\nreal world links</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v2.10.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/91\">Fix\ngetLocalRef() returns wrong ref</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v2.10.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dorny/paths-filter/pull/85\">Improve\nrobustness of c