tained Talon WhatsApp bridge npm\npackage.\n- Add Dependabot Docker coverage for the maintained Talon example\nDockerfile on `main`.\n- Leave release/N-1 branch `target-branch` coverage out of scope for\nthis repo; that policy applies only to `langchainplus` and\n`langgraph-api`.\n- Leave dataset fixture Dockerfiles under\n`libs/evals/datasets/context-retrieval-evals/*/environment` unmanaged.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- [x] Compared dependency roots on `main` against\n`.github/dependabot.yml` coverage.\n- [x] Parsed `.github/dependabot.yml` with Ruby YAML.\n- [x] Ran `git diff --check`.\n\n## Notes\n\nOpened as draft so maintainers can confirm the Talon Dockerfile should\nbe covered.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Langster <john@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"e19a805b3b606cf1f14307c8ec42320acd0ee2b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e19a805b3b606cf1f14307c8ec42320acd0ee2b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/4ddb361b99857c1fc23afb9ada0a68162c190f74","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVv9JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFWYQADe/Xmnn8+sn1wq9OF9FMUKT\na6DokjBQb9cZRddi5f4mFRGu0mkYSjSAqZ7m45GGGlKQ3gzLsquZh2QWVng1wmDm\ns7Ny+b6AYLu7o6Hw3JSFnA5hElJhCeNd507ui8cAoy0mptHeHIhQBabUOv3kWeKa\nPc04YBvShAui7PUf6NTJwJxUcTpO1FU+9L5tgsYxfaauVkGmlFjVsm5O3BJtEFkq\n7ZaX63oRvpeP8meQA0gmuwvckXDYtMw3itBcyx/ztmLvtn0PUaqAFkdhUeBnMNAv\nKWtHLWyUqN2F+5diCieGV5HSihFBgULXyBvGkCJnSWrnmGBZfhXK81jMyVC0oFW7\nAamMji1nkODqVzz3dfL3nSws4QPRS4QP2FozfEKT87w/LzFMZN0JarUpLfEVW3Pl\nUI/5aTl5xlz1L/7mKRKReeQt9c5j3he9TFrm8aiq8YvTWXZfwXs57xUFFJesk3dG\neDnpXFZwTplQ1sk6f8WSu9ozLmkzOG/DaAC2lL3ywJOkj5qzr43o538tJt07rPva\nJZdfqwOgPKnICtKqs+v8xwJpDT2dTmGSCZbPD0CBt2vXBpND4VQs0QKY6qtl6fIm\nmYUqkCBImWWROWx2UM1oic7WTxrkZnxqV50XvuINc7pL6UCvb2I+3eyK7ZhzP54k\nf7a0VgIcXwBSjrTvD3nf\n=T3Qy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e19a805b3b606cf1f14307c8ec42320acd0ee2b7\nparent 226