7-14T23:06:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-14T23:06:27Z"},"message":"fix(code): deduplicate content from system prompt by overwriting base prompt (#4516)\n\nDepends on alpha release of new SDK changes\n\ndcode's system prompt appears as though it was intended to replace the\nbase system prompt instead of augmenting it (some of the sections are\nalmost identical).\n\nhttps://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/pull/4437 introduced a\nmechanism to overwrite the base prompt. Here we apply it in dcode.\n\nReview system prompt snapshot for effective changes.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf4ac44434f31652ef3fa2d68ad5bdebac4931ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/bf4ac44434f31652ef3fa2d68ad5bdebac4931ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/2266f58e4713d23ba0b30eb8646424d01165c11b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVsDzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmBYQADq94Hx//X7ewSZ+McK8A0q/\nYppeVyuQ66wUgNuavmONSsYtRFBpNi3Hs7qqe/oXcZu/aHUTS+jya4lUcOJ7oPME\n7tV8+RfsvCr/EFEiYsd84e0Qw3Jl6EvImvwOJGbRFb0IxAylILRRU2fiT/tQBUm1\nJheblcfcpENvS2Hc4LkHJXrVUh3Mh40wPattut+m2TDn65jdcQ2ss+hwzEzmse7v\nn4Q3q8e3pyrC9IVgLL6QAZ58qV15vEB2tJ48P6A9eY62x3xpl5O9dAoHniYxiy74\nt55kGyDKQbpNtGTuuBVm7c0Dpok/VVDnGPdLvotwhtqdmfusTjibj65ej8NspaxA\nvkcla72u0Wu8HIgl2pFaUJ/PazUaZX9Wp5D6LdYpW48KOQrWGB4yfrcvFj0FbVTF\nOLtNQ0EMmM/XSCmpt6cIg4N13iEyJ1SVfQZ/Kn3TVoo+Cv2zWy5+zUpqzG6E1X1O\no1nAUNvJTDM/OEoSvW2e6EtbRaQ4V/QbZQlr3v8t5ug2e9vlSEDErvQXmAsfCEv2\nPnbAFcnEnY7lk/AmuB2he29YuhLS6IVAGOWzh5i46AEHaZ7PAIPxmLFRCJfJc8ZO\nugvB0KfOFyLZqqLFQluXFZ1ATUJdv9QxiQiEwV6hRB/wGvm1wYer3j2GFUGdNeD7\nKWBme7wpi6vBqaHxDf7O\n=W06W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree bf4ac44434f31652ef3fa2d68ad5bdebac4931ed\nparent e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3\nauthor ccurme <chester.curme@gmail.com> 1784070387 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784070387 -0400\n\nfix(code): deduplicate content from system prompt by overwriting base prompt (#4516)\n\nDepends on alpha release of new SDK changes\n\ndcode's system prompt appears as though it was intended to replace the\nbase system prompt instead of augmenting it (some of the sections are\nalmost identical).\n\nhttps://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/pull/4437 introduced a\nmechanism to overwrite the base prompt. Here we apply it in dcode.\n\nReview system prompt snapshot for effective changes.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-14T23:06:28Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2266f58e4713d23ba0b30eb8646424d01165c11b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2266f58e4713d23ba0b30eb8646424d01165c11b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2266f58e4713d23ba0b30eb8646424d01165c11b/comments","author":{"login":"ccurme","id":26529506,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTI5NTA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26529506?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme","html_url":"https://github.com/ccurme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ccurme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3"}]},{"sha":"e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGU1MGUyMzgzMjYxYmEzOTkyM2I1ZDZjNDhiN2ZlM2IwNTg0NzVjZDM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-14T23:06:21Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-14T23:06:21Z"},"message":"feat(code): toast to re-paste when a chat paste collapses (#4742)\n\nPasting large multi-line text into the chat input now shows a toast\nnoting the paste was collapsed and can be pasted again to expand it\ninline.\n\n---\n\nPasting a large, multi-line clipboard payload into the chat input\ncollapses it into a compact `[Pasted text #N]` placeholder. That\nbehavior is discoverable only if you already know that pasting the\nidentical content a second time expands it inline. This surfaces a short\ntoast at the moment of collapse so the affordance is visible.\n\nThe notification fires only when a *new* placeholder is inserted —\nrepeat-paste expansion of an existing placeholder stays silent — and it\nroutes through the single collapse funnel\n(`ChatInput._collapse_and_insert_paste`), so bracketed pastes, paste\nbursts, and app-level paste routing all get it. The message is a static\nliteral sent with `markup=False`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/100a1495-af57-cbd8-abbb-5f682db12646)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccd22f82b8fbcb6f2eef12d6c7fbe916fa9135bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/ccd22f82b8fbcb6f2eef12d6c7fbe916fa9135bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVsDtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+h8QADpGBJ7tcmmuyp8tru9s9ar+\nlCkaLWQkhEOvU8VTbkRLoHgbc3r/XFcuv/nU+4qimtC0GGTgX46lPK15LY21J4fS\n/VUo52uUhR5w9NOnj3xn7euklnsY4CRyqr061OJVTPTit2Q2Db+nc0mx0Ua/yVXS\nHRCkrGxbm6oKnu4rnxsGLMqbPcVzvGGapR8cAf4igQmckYkQmTl3QuJFf+i7lUwo\ne0nxR1RFm8XispM6p9kxf4B28B3ckfT3tbRrlDv6vO3qIIFjrejMsIomATuQLKfn\nwThTzJ3fYOG1kDq8GtBk9cCYLJWetPUHSwTyMSxRPLZ9D3vQNWkNGKRQm790SGHl\naglgwDo7pQsf7T7YkKcOgtFYlYnkZwhDVnS4bg8rovF0Y0hropoB42sZcWOrOG6b\nU3tCa42b9o5zd4nxYwwGm7YzAa9F0UXJVIm0AeTCFLJsarp9yidWConjR33uTFKo\nL5KKUf0NAiyVAobAITqXtnn71fAzqfrAZ5y9oMxb6APXoTSmW5LsMxpk8Qs/ef+g\ndoY0xRUA/DpJw4hEbbK7tGImZwKhGRfVxpVpxNNFWhfwZb1ms9+gWwipRHqglFX5\nb1kQN1YLvyOYaibpimer6SuXLLlfXJ4GGyDW6OWkikrwFvebmiG6j4h03y8wnEYE\noCIy0nmU68PSEH6F5TxA\n=V+AM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ccd22f82b8fbcb6f2eef12d6c7fbe916fa9135bc\nparent 132f9f7a3059e67927beaac96fe841b7f132a8a3\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784070381 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784070381 -0400\n\nfeat(code): toast to re-paste when a chat paste collapses (#4742)\n\nPasting large multi-line text into the chat input now shows a toast\nnoting the paste was collapsed and can be pasted again to expand it\ninline.\n\n---\n\nPasting a large, multi-line clipboard payload into the chat input\ncollapses it into a compact `[Pasted text #N]` placeholder. That\nbehavior is discoverable only if you already know that pasting the\nidentical content a second time expands it inline. This surfaces a short\ntoast at the moment of collapse so the affordance is visible.\n\nThe notification fires only when a *new* placeholder is inserted —\nrepeat-paste expansion of an existing placeholder stays silent — and it\nroutes through the single collapse funnel\n(`ChatInput._collapse_and_insert_paste`), so bracketed pastes, paste\nbursts, and app-level paste routing all get it. The message is a static\nliteral sent with `markup=False`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/100a1495-af57-cbd8-abbb-5f682db12646)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-14T23:06:22Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e50e2383261ba39923b5d6c48b7fe3b058475cd3/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url"